WEBVTT

00:05.440 --> 00:09.240
In your best moments, you are focused, clear and grounded.

00:10.360 --> 00:16.560
Then the hard days come and someone else shows up — reactive, scattered, exhausted.

00:17.640 --> 00:22.840
From the outside, everything looks fine.

00:23.900 --> 00:28.120
From the inside, you are performing a version of yourself that no longer fits.

00:30.210 --> 00:31.820
That is not a discipline problem.

00:32.940 --> 00:34.180
That is an identity gap.

00:35.300 --> 00:38.930
The distance between who you are and who you have decided to become.

00:41.030 --> 00:42.760
Naming the gap is the first step.

00:43.890 --> 00:46.100
Not with more pressure — with clarity.

00:48.940 --> 00:54.300
Answer a few honest questions and take the free identity assessment right below this video.
